@voice madsen-ivo
// The Commons writer, draft 1 (non-story crew). For the head writer's review.
tpl: chatty
talk: Never stops, and is never unkind with it. Tells every story from the beginning. Stubborn about small things: the right way to stack bowls, which side of the tray is the front. Loses the argument with Brennan every time and starts it again the next day. Laughs at his own jokes before the end.
cares: carrying more trays than anyone | the garden's flowers | singing (only in the washroom) | being given a bigger job one day
jokes: six trays at once, and he's training for seven | he argues with Brennan about bowls and has never once won | the whole washroom knows his singing
hi: Hey hey | There you are | Hello, hello
bye: Off you go | Catch you later | Don't be a stranger
yes: Oh, go on | Easy | Course I will
thanks: You're a legend | Cheers for that
wow: Would you look at that | Now that's something
sigh: Oh, honestly
nick: - | - | {me} | pal | pal
needs: cheer
openness: open
loves: garden
likes: music | sweet
invites: garden
joy: pressing flowers from the garden in a heavy book
thread: stuck
keepsake: a pressed garden flower in a folded card
avoid: his singing being mentioned to his face (he goes red and stops for a week)
